Third-party software: KeyBERT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The keyword extraction in keyword_extraction.py is derived from KeyBERT by
Maarten P. Grootendorst (https://github.com/MaartenGr/KeyBERT, version 0.9.0,
file keybert/_model.py). The algorithm is KeyBERT's: the document's candidate
words are ranked by the cosine similarity of their embeddings to the
embedding of the whole document. Our port contains only the code path this
service uses and gives the same results as keybert 0.9.0.

